        <mxCell id="n50" value="The deep link zoldify://payment/return only navigates the UI. The single source&lt;br&gt;of truth for &quot;this was paid&quot; is the PayOS webhook hitting the backend — a user&lt;br&gt;can close the browser before being redirected, and a URL can be typed by hand.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The seller block is roughly half the total app work. Cut to 5 core screens&lt;br&gt;because the team is four people; sellers keep the full flow on the web." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#c8a415;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="700" width="620" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
